<section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><div class="breadcrumb">East Sussex Roofing / Evidence</div><h1>Projects should show the problem, the work, and the outcome.</h1><p>This first build leaves space for management-approved project records. Real locations, accurate captions, and useful before-and-after detail belong here.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell split"><div><div class="kicker">Content gate</div><h2>Evidence over decoration.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Project pages will only be published when the business can confirm the location, customer-visible problem, work completed, outcome, image rights, and any wording about reviews or guarantees.</p><p>Placeholder project cards are deliberately not presented as completed work.</p></div></div></section>
