<section class="section"><div class="shell split"><div><div class="kicker">Project record</div><h2>Photo and video evidence all the way through.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>For suitable projects, the proposed record is simple: agree what may be captured, take a before view, document key stages such as opening up or rebattening, and add an after view with a short factual summary.</p><p>Any drone footage, customer property, people, vehicle details, addresses, or neighbouring properties need a separate safety, privacy, and consent check. Do not publish a project record until management approves the evidence and wording.</p></div></div></section>
